{
  "npc": {
    "slug": "the-general",
    "name": "The General",
    "category": "wanderers"
  },
  "entryCount": 23,
  "pools": {
    "reaction": 6,
    "gamblingTrashTalk": 11,
    "gamblingBrag": 1,
    "threat": 5
  },
  "moods": {
    "neutral": 1,
    "scared": 1,
    "threatening": 8,
    "pleased": 9,
    "amused": 3,
    "annoyed": 1
  },
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "cb-the-general-wuce0f",
      "text": "Well if it ain't the huckster with a microphone for a soul. You still peddling t-shirts on the boy who can't stay in the ground, X-treme?",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "the-general",
        "name": "The General",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "reaction",
      "mood": "neutral",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:dust"
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-09-22-563Z/days/day-0001.md",
        "extractedDay": 1,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:25.997Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-the-general-c7wn29",
      "text": "Good. Three wins and that bow still sittin' pretty on top, darlin' - you're runnin' hotter than that corona up there. Don't let it slip, though; last thing I need's your shadow doin' the countin' for me.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "the-general",
        "name": "The General",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "reaction",
      "mood": "scared",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:heat"
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-09-22-563Z/days/day-0003.md",
        "extractedDay": 3,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:25.998Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-the-general-ia443s",
      "text": "Good. Lose the coin, keep the lesson, Willy - that boy died worse than this hand and still came back cheaper than you'll ever be. Smug looks fine on a one-eyed man till the dice remember his name.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "the-general",
        "name": "The General",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": -2,
      "contextTags": [],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-09-22-563Z/days/day-0005.md",
        "extractedDay": 5,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:25.999Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-the-general-n400dy",
      "text": "Five and three ain't a streak, Detective, that's a coin flip with good lawyers. Two losses just means the house is due - and you're looking at the house.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "the-general",
        "name": "The General",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingBrag",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": -2,
      "contextTags": [],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-09-22-563Z/days/day-0005.md",
        "extractedDay": 5,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:25.999Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-the-general-m7ml6y",
      "text": "X-treme. Still peddling t-shirts on a dead man's back, I see. Good - somebody ought to profit off him, may as well be a familiar face.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "the-general",
        "name": "The General",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "reaction",
      "mood": "pleased",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:dust"
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-24-14-611Z/days/day-0001.md",
        "extractedDay": 1,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.002Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-the-general-17ktvd",
      "text": "Good. That's three clean wins stitched tight, girl - you keep that bow on straight and the shadow don't need to say a word. Meanwhile I'm 0 and 1 like a green recruit, so don't let it go to your head - you all came cheap, but you're earning your keep today.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "the-general",
        "name": "The General",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "reaction",
      "mood": "pleased",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:heat"
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-24-14-611Z/days/day-0003.md",
        "extractedDay": 3,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.003Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-the-general-lraxz5",
      "text": "Detective. That briefcase of yours summons all of Hell, and here I am, still owing less than you do. Three and three - you're batting even money on a contract that never lets you fold. Good. That's the kind of debt I respect.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "the-general",
        "name": "The General",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "threat",
      "mood": "pleased",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:heat"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-24-14-611Z/days/day-0003.md",
        "extractedDay": 3,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.003Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-the-general-ef2wcx",
      "text": "Good. That's the sound of a man who don't know he's already spent. Smirk while you can, One Eye - the boy came back cheap and mean today, and luck's got a way of switching pockets when you least deserve it.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "the-general",
        "name": "The General",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": -2,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "playerArchetype": "chaotic"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-24-14-611Z/days/day-0005.md",
        "extractedDay": 5,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.004Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-the-general-3g25qm",
      "text": "Five and three don't scare me, Detective - that's just Hell's paperwork catching up with your luck. Two losses is a debt, not a pattern, and I always collect what's owed. You all came cheap, but that streak of yours? That's gonna cost you.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "the-general",
        "name": "The General",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "threat",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": -2,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "playerArchetype": "chaotic",
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-24-14-611Z/days/day-0005.md",
        "extractedDay": 5,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.004Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-the-general-yhthwu",
      "text": "Well if it ain't Boo G, still runnin' that mouth the Pit spat back up. Three wins deep and my dice still hot, so mind how you talk to me today. Heard the boy hit himself a new personal best out there - good. Real good. Means his bill's climbin' too.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "the-general",
        "name": "The General",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "amused",
      "moodIntensity": 3,
      "contextTags": [],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-29-16-854Z/days/day-0009.md",
        "extractedDay": 9,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.006Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-the-general-avm3uo",
      "text": "Bones. Still counting other men's bones for a living, I see - good, somebody honest ought to. Three wins deep tonight, and the boy's still a hundred light in my ledger, so don't look at me like the cold wind's my fault.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "the-general",
        "name": "The General",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "reaction",
      "mood": "amused",
      "moodIntensity": 3,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:frost"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-29-16-854Z/days/day-0011.md",
        "extractedDay": 11,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.007Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-the-general-bago5",
      "text": "Bones, that whistle still fits funny on a skeleton, but three wins on your ledger to my five tells me the gap's closing where it counts. My boy still owes me a hundred, and my dice been running hot as a branding iron - you sure you wanna smell what I'm cooking tonight?",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "the-general",
        "name": "The General",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "amused",
      "moodIntensity": 3,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-29-16-854Z/days/day-0012.md",
        "extractedDay": 12,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.008Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-the-general-2z5mi1",
      "text": "Smug on a 5-and-6 record, Bones. That whistle's for hesitation, not for dice. Roll again before the newcomer's debt makes cowards of us both.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "the-general",
        "name": "The General",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "annoyed",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:wild"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-36-08-597Z/days/day-0015.md",
        "extractedDay": 15,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.010Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-the-general-6ga8df",
      "text": "Doc, your data's smug but your record's even, six and five, same as a coin flip with a lab coat on. Boy still owes me a hundred, and you keep dosing him back to life before he can pay it off. Good, actually. Keeps the bill running.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "the-general",
        "name": "The General",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "threat",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:wild"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-36-08-597Z/days/day-0015.md",
        "extractedDay": 15,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.010Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-the-general-71gb44",
      "text": "Easy now. The Moon's cold enough without you burning gold on tilt, girl. Boy still owes me a hundred, you're only down what, half that on a bad roll. Good. Means you got room left to lose to me next.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "the-general",
        "name": "The General",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "pleased",
      "moodIntensity": 1,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:frost"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-36-08-597Z/days/day-0017.md",
        "extractedDay": 17,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.011Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-the-general-ie7lmt",
      "text": "Well look at you, King. Two and oh, sitting pretty in the corona while the rest of us freeze on the rock below. Good.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "the-general",
        "name": "The General",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "reaction",
      "mood": "pleased",
      "moodIntensity": 1,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:frost"
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-36-08-597Z/days/day-0017.md",
        "extractedDay": 17,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.011Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-the-general-9hzw0j",
      "text": "Three and oh, your majesty. Sun never sets on that record, does it. Meanwhile my boy's still down a hundred gold, still breathing anyway, and that's the part costs me sleep.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "the-general",
        "name": "The General",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "pleased",
      "moodIntensity": 1,
      "contextTags": [],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-36-08-597Z/days/day-0020.md",
        "extractedDay": 20,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.013Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-the-general-fp8uiw",
      "text": "Willy, that one-eye of yours still counts gold better than it counts odds. Boy's stitched back up and breathing, so we're square on rescues. Now let's talk about my 225, before I start collecting interest in teeth.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "the-general",
        "name": "The General",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "pleased",
      "moodIntensity": 1,
      "contextTags": [],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-36-08-597Z/days/day-0021.md",
        "extractedDay": 21,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.014Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-the-general-ww3gz0",
      "text": "Willy One-Eye's out there doing my collecting for me now. Good. Saves me the trip, and the boy still owes me 225 either way, dead or breathing.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "the-general",
        "name": "The General",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "threat",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-38-40-638Z/days/day-0022.md",
        "extractedDay": 22,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.014Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-the-general-vufq9c",
      "text": "Doc, you carry mercy in a needle and still can't hit better than a coin flip. Boy owes me 225 he'll never earn honest, and you're smug over 10 and 11. Roll the bones, I'll take your gold cheap, same as I took his.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "the-general",
        "name": "The General",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-38-40-638Z/days/day-0023.md",
        "extractedDay": 23,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.014Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-the-general-fbd2rm",
      "text": "Sixteen and sixteen, Detective. Even Hell's paperwork breaks that clean. I'm one loss deep tonight, but the boy owes me 225 gold, so the house always wins eventually. Good. Roll the bones.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "the-general",
        "name": "The General",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "threatening",
      "moodIntensity": 0,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:death"
      ],
      "triggers": {
        "debtTension": "minor"
      },
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-38-40-638Z/days/day-0026.md",
        "extractedDay": 26,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.015Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-the-general-dowuu6",
      "text": "Two losses don't scare me, Voss, they're just tuition. Your boy's serum made me hard to kill, not hard to beat at dice. Roll clean, or I'll file this under mercy and take your gold anyway.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "the-general",
        "name": "The General",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "gamblingTrashTalk",
      "mood": "pleased",
      "moodIntensity": 1,
      "contextTags": [
        "weather:void"
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "extractedFrom": "/Users/kevin/Projects/NEVERDIEGUY26/packages/ai-engine/logs/eternal-2026-07-09T00-38-40-638Z/days/day-0027.md",
        "extractedDay": 27,
        "extractedAt": "2026-07-09T00:40:26.016Z",
        "version": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cb-the-general-t520gp",
      "text": "Bound to that throne and still counting my wins for me, King. Good. Somebody in this corridor's keeping score straight, since the boy sure ain't paying his.",
      "speaker": {
        "slug": "the-general",
        "name": "The General",
        "category": "wanderers"
      },
      "pool": "threat",
      "mood": "pleased",
      "moodIntensity": 1,
      "contextTags": [],
      "metrics": {
        "interestScore": 70,
        "source": "eternal_sim"
      },
      "metadata": {
